# Description of this project and its data for research data management.
# Every field is optional. pyglotaran reads none of them and copies this file into every export.
title: Target analysis of calix[4]arene-perylene bisimide dye conjugates
description: >
  pyglotaran example: target analysis of transient absorption data with one dataset
  (transient_absorption_target_analysis.ipynb) and with two datasets
  (transient_absorption_two_dataset_analysis.ipynb).
data_description: >
  Transient absorption data of Figures 5 to 9 of Hippius et al., "Excited State Interactions in
  Calix[4]arene-Perylene Bisimide Dye Conjugates: Global and Target Analysis of Supramolecular
  Building Blocks", J. Phys. Chem. C 2007, 111, 13988-13996
  (data/demo_data_Hippius_etal_JPCC2007_111_13988_Figs5_9.ascii).
creators:
  - name:
    orcid:
    affiliation:
keywords: [transient absorption, target analysis]
license:
related_identifiers:
  - doi: 10.1021/jp0733825
